# prov_o 2013-04-30 + olia 2026-04-09 — the STRIPED SPAR/OLiA OWL vocabs, flipped
# to byte-exact graph-faithful by the L3 byte kernel: the verbatim internal-subset
# DOCTYPE (`<!DOCTYPE rdf:RDF [ <!ENTITY …> ]>`) as PROLOG residue, the §4.1
# numeric (`&#39;`) and general-entity (`&rdfs;seeAlso`) reference forms as the
# `ExtendedRef` residue, and the interspersed §2.5 comments as the
# `ChildSlot::InsertComment` residue — all STRUCTURED concrete-syntax, NO stored
# DOM, NO raw blob. The recursive node-block writer regenerates the element
